 men suspected of deadly church attack after shootout","href":"/news/articles/cm4g17qq8wz4o","isLiveNow":false,"metadata":{"contentType":"article","subtype":"news","lastUpdated":1793012476180,"firstUpdated":1793012476180,"topics":["Middle East"]},"tags":[],"description":"No group has yet said it was behind Friday's shooting attack in the village of Hmoud, which left nine Christians dead.","image":{"type":"indexImage","model":{"blocks":{"src":"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/6bbd/live/f830f0d0-d128-11f1-a701-fddedf244c16.jpg","altText":"Jordanian security personnel carry the coffins of victims of a church shooting in Karak, Jordan (25 October 2026)","width":1999,"height":1125}}},"relatedUrls":[],"id":"urn:bbc:optimo:asset:cm4g17qq8wz4o","brandName":"","seriesName":"","seriesId":"","brandId":"","versionId":""},{"title":"Rapper Nicki Minaj joins Trump onstage at Michigan rally","href":"/news/articles/cqrmyl1mljppo","isLiveNow":false,"metadata":{"contentType":"article","subtype":"news","lastUpdated":1792971199873,"firstUpdated":1792971199873,"topics":["US \u0026 Canada"]},"tags":[],"description":"The Super Bass singer is the latest big name to campaign in Michigan, where a tight Senate race is playing out ahead of the 3 November midterms.  ","image":{"type":"indexImage","model":{"blocks":{"src":"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/8395/live/f35a8d90-d0fc-11f1-9d25-c3fafb2ab4de.jpg","altText":"Nicki Minaj at the microphone at a podium with the presidential seal. She has a slight smile and a gold suit with a Gucci logo. Trump smiles behind her. ","width":878,"height":494}}},"relatedUrls":[],"id":"urn:bbc:optimo:asset:cqrmyl1mljppo","brandName":"","seriesName":"","seriesId":"","brandId":"","versionId":""},{"title":"Russia to host first Olympic federation world event since Ukraine invasion","href":"/sport/olympics/articles/cmq5ny00gzy0o","isLiveNow":false,"metadata":{"contentType":"article","subtype":"sport","lastUpdated":1792938873528,"firstUpdated":179